    (xi) Knowingly obstructs the free and unobstructed passage of any vessel through any navigable body of water;

    (xii) Knowingly discharges a firearm in a public place in a reckless manner;

    (xiii) Knowingly discharges a firearm in a public place in a manner that creates a risk of bodily injury to another person;

    (xiv) Knowingly discharges a firearm within a residential area;

    (xv) Knowingly exposes the person's person, or engages in conduct, in a public place, which is grossly insulting or likely to cause serious annoyance or alarm to persons of ordinary sensibilities;

    (xvi) Knowingly exposes the person's person, or engages in conduct, in a private place, which is grossly insulting or likely to cause serious annoyance or alarm to another person.

